{"schemaVersion":"stemist-university-profile-v1","id":"university-of-oxford","kind":"verified-overview","updatedOn":"2026-10-22","scope":"本科课程常规学术门槛范围；不是所有专业同一条件","summary":"A-Level AAA–A*A*A；IB 38–40，依专业而定。","sections":[{"label":"学术要求","text":"常规 A-Level 要求按课程约为 AAA 至 A*A*A；IB 通常 38、39 或 40 分（含核心分），HL 要求含 6／7，具体科目与组合见课程页。","sourceIds":["international","guide"]},{"label":"专业附加条件","text":"部分课程另有指定学科、入学测试、书面材料和面试；先核对所选专业的官方要求表。达到成绩条件不保证录取。","sourceIds":["table","guide"]}],"sources":[{"id":"international","title":"Oxford · International qualifications","url":"https://www.ox.ac.uk/admissions/undergraduate/courses/admissions-requirements/international-qualifications"},{"id":"table","title":"Oxford · Admissions requirements table","url":"https://www.ox.ac.uk/admissions/undergraduate/courses/admissions-requirements/summary-table-of-admissions-requirements"},{"id":"guide","title":"Oxford · International undergraduate guide","url":"https://www.ox.ac.uk/sites/files/oxford/field/field_document/Guide%20for%20International%20students.pdf"},{"id":"programmes","title":"专业与课程官网","url":"https://www.ox.ac.uk/admissions/undergraduate/courses/undergraduate-course-listing-a-z"}],"notice":"摘要不能替代当年课程要求或正式 offer；请结合自己的资格与专业核对。"}
